<h3 id="understanding-results" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Understanding Results</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#understanding-results" aria-label="Link to Understanding Results"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>Look for these metrics in the output:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Execution Time</strong>: Total query duration</li>
<li><strong>Buffers</strong>: Shared hits vs reads from disk</li>
<li><strong>I/O Timing</strong>: Time spent on I/O operations</li>
</ul>
<p>Enable I/O timing for more detailed information:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="sql"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">ALTER</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SYSTEM</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SET</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> track_io_timing </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> on</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">SELECT</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> pg_reload_conf();</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-4" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<h2 id="monitoring-asynchronous-io-operations" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Monitoring Asynchronous I/O Operations</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#monitoring-asynchronous-io-operations" aria-label="Link to Monitoring Asynchronous I/O Operations"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<h3 id="checking-background-workers" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Checking Background Workers</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#checking-background-workers" aria-label="Link to Checking Background Workers"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>When using the <code>worker</code> method, monitor I/O worker processes:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="sql"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)">-- View background processes</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">SELECT</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">    pid,</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">    application_name,</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">    backend_type,</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">    state</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">,</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="7"><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">    wait_event_type,</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="8"><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">    wait_event</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="9"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">FROM</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> pg_stat_activity</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="10"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">WHERE</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> backend_type </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">LIKE</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;%worker%&#x27;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="11"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">   OR</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> application_name </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">LIKE</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;%io%&#x27;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="12"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">ORDER BY</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> backend_type, pid;</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-4" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<h3 id="system-level-monitoring" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>System-Level Monitoring</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#system-level-monitoring" aria-label="Link to System-Level Monitoring"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>If your PostgreSQL server is running on Linux, you can monitor I/O activity using system tools:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="bash"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)"># Monitor I/O operations (Linux)</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">iostat</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string)"> -x</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)"> 1</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)"># Watch PostgreSQL processes</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-function)">watch</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;ps aux | grep postgres&#x27;</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-4" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<p>With <code>iostat</code>, you can see disk I/O statistics, including read/write operations and latency.</p>
<h3 id="available-monitoring-views" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Available Monitoring Views</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#available-monitoring-views" aria-label="Link to Available Monitoring Views"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>PostgreSQL 18 includes new system views to help monitor asynchronous I/O operations. You can query these views to get insights into I/O performance:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="sql"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)">-- Look for AIO-related system views</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">SELECT</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> schemaname, viewname</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">FROM</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> pg_views</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">WHERE</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> viewname </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">LIKE</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;%aio%&#x27;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">   OR</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> viewname </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">LIKE</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;%async%&#x27;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">   OR</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> viewname </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">LIKE</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;%io%&#x27;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">;</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-4" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<p>Note that some monitoring features may not be available in Beta 1 or could change before the final release.</p>
<h2 id="performance-tuning" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Performance Tuning</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#performance-tuning" aria-label="Link to Performance Tuning"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>The exact performance improvements from asynchronous I/O depend on your workload and hardware, but what you can usually do is:</p>
<h3 id="adjusting-io-workers" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Adjusting I/O Workers</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#adjusting-io-workers" aria-label="Link to Adjusting I/O Workers"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>For the <code>worker</code> method, adjust the number of workers based on your system:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="sql"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)">-- For systems with many CPU cores and high I/O latency</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">ALTER</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SYSTEM</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SET</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> io_workers </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)"> 8</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)">-- For smaller systems or fast local storage</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">ALTER</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SYSTEM</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SET</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> io_workers </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)"> 2</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">;</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-4" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<p>Start with a worker count around half your CPU cores and adjust based on testing.</p>
<h3 id="memory-settings" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Memory Settings</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#memory-settings" aria-label="Link to Memory Settings"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>Configure memory settings to work well with async I/O:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="sql"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)">-- Adjust shared buffers</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">ALTER</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SYSTEM</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SET</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> shared_buffers </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;1GB&#x27;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)">-- Increase work memory for large operations</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">ALTER</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SYSTEM</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SET</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> work_mem </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;16MB&#x27;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"></span>
<span class="line" data-line="7"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)">-- Enable huge pages if available</span></span>
