<h3 id="io-concurrency" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>I/O Concurrency</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#io-concurrency" aria-label="Link to I/O Concurrency"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>Async I/O works better with higher concurrency settings:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="sql"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)">-- Increase effective I/O concurrency</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">ALTER</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SYSTEM</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SET</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> effective_io_concurrency </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-constant)"> 32</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-comment)">-- Increase maintenance I/O concurrency</span></span>
